# OUTCOME REVIEW, 2026-09-27 (window: cycles 101–106 complete, cycle 107 in progress)

**Verdict: refuted.** A new VI file exists, but it has never run, so the user can run nothing new. Since 04:30 today nothing runs on the rig PC at all, including the unchanged copy of the original.

Two limits on this review: I could not check `claudeDev\` (it is outside the repository; the `Track_v6_CPU_*` glob found nothing), so VI md5s are as STATUS states them. I used no external sources.

## 1. DELIVERABLE

Nothing runnable was added.

